# Module layout

New features belong in `src/modules/<feature>/`:

```
<feature>.module.ts
<feature>.controller.ts
<feature>.service.ts
<feature>.schema.ts
*.workflow.ts / *.present.ts / *.util.ts   # pure helpers when useful
tests/*.spec.ts
```

## Rules

- Controllers: `@Controller({ version: '1' })`, thin — map `@CurrentUser()` / `@OptionalUser()` to service calls
- Services: `@Injectable()`, inject `@Inject(APP_DB) private readonly db: Kysely<DB>`
- Keep state machines / presentation as pure functions (see `signals/signal.workflow.ts`, `signal.present.ts`)
- Wire the module in `src/app.module.ts`
- Never add code under legacy `src/qrcode/` or `src/uploads/`

## Good references

- Domain: `src/modules/signals/`
- Media + `{code,message}` errors: `src/modules/audio/`
